"pull_request","pull_request_review","pull_request_review_comment","push","registry_package","release","repository","repository_dispatch","status","watch","workflow_dispatch","workflow_run"]},"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/comments/3534219781","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/issues/2629#issuecomment-3534219781","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/2629","id":3534219781,"node_id":"IC_kwDOEFLz887Sp-oF","user":{"login":"thfi","id":2264227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNjQyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2264227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/thfi","html_url":"https://github.com/thfi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thfi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thfi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thfi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thfi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thfi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thfi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thfi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thfi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thfi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-14T19:18:39Z","updated_at":"2025-11-14T19:18:39Z","body":"For anyone looking for an automated solution to backup the database: I addressed backup'ing the database the follow way. As headscale is started and stopped via systemd, add an override configuration that copies the database to another file each time the service is stopped. In the example below, the backup's filename contains the file's MD5 checksum to avoid having multiple copies of the same database and the headscale version number in case there are incompatible changes across versions. File properties like modification dates are kept when copying, allowing to identify old copies that one can delete.\n\n1. Create the file `/etc/systemd/system/headscale.service.d/backup-config.conf` as follows:\n    ```\n    [Service]\n    ExecStopPost=/usr/bin/bash -c 'cp --verbose --preserve=all /var/lib/headscale/db.sqlite /var/lib/headscale/\"$(headscale version|grep -Po --color=NEVER \"(?<=v?)[01](\\\\.[0-9]+)+\"|head -n1)\"-\"$(md5sum <\"/var/lib/headscale/db.sqlite\"|cut -f1 -d \" \")\"-db.sqlite'\n    ```\n2. Tell systemd to reload the updated configuration: `systemctl daemon-reload`","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/comments/3534219781/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/comments/3987391621","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/issues/2629#issuecomment-3987391621","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/2629","id":3987391621,"node_id":"IC_kwDOEFLz887tqsSF","user":{"login":"thfi","id":2264227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNjQyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2264227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/thfi","html_url":"https://github.com/thfi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thfi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thfi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thfi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thfi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thfi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thfi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thfi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thfi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thfi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-02T22:43:49Z","updated_at":"2026-03-02T22:43:49Z","body":"Just tested with the latest stable version:\n\n$ headscale version\nheadscale version v0.28.0\ncommit: 97fa117c48a58bee3941e5e8b4393873501afe14\nbuild time: 2026-02-04T20:26:22Z\nbuilt with: go1.25.5 linux/amd64\n\n$ headscale version|grep -Po --color=NEVER \n\"(?<=v?)[01](\\\\.[0-9]+)+\"|head -n1\n0.28.0\n\n\nI suspect your problem is more related to `grep`. The version I am using \nGNU grep 3.11, where `grep -P` uses \"PCRE2 10.46 2025-08-27\"\n\nRemoving `(?<=v?)` from regular expression the seems to work as well, \nreturning the same version string. Test if that works better for you.\n\n\nOn 27.02.26 00:20, Tom Grushka wrote:\n> *tgrushka* left a comment (juanfont/headscale#2629) <https://github.com/ \n> juanfont/headscale/issues/2629#issuecomment-3969814965>\n> \n> Thank you, @thfi <https://github.com/thfi> . The lookbehind regex in \n> your example did not work for me, as I got:\n> |grep: lookbehind assertion is not fixed length|\n> \n> Maybe it was for a beta or pre-release version?\n> \n> This version works for me. You had a great idea to do this in a separate \n> systemd \"add-on\" file that doesn't get overwritten by the package:\n> \n> |[Service] ExecStopPost=/usr/bin/bash -c 'cp --verbose --preserve=all / \n> var/lib/headscale/db.sqlite /var/lib/headscale/backup-$(headscale \n> version)-$(md5sum < /var/lib/headscale/db.sqlite | cut -f1 -d \" \")- \n> db.sqlite' |\n> \n> This yields filenames like:\n> |backup-0.26.0-43d67d794fcd3dc4f1bcc84f527dec47-db.sqlite|\n> \n> —\n> Reply to this email directly, view it on GitHub <https://github.com/ \n> juanfont/headscale/issues/2629#issuecomment-3969814965>, or unsubscribe \n> <https://github.com/notifications/unsubscribe-auth/ \n> AARIZIZOAEQQSPOFJRXDQT34N55U7AVCNFSM6AAAAAB56R363GVHI2DSMVQWIX3LMV43OSLTON2WKQ3PNVWWK3TUHMZTSNRZHAYTIOJWGU>.\n> You are receiving this because you were mentioned.Message ID: <juanfont/ \n> ***@***.***>\n> \n\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/comments/3987391621/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]